---
interface Props { lang?: 'ko' | 'en'; }
const english = Astro.props.lang === 'en';
---
<figure class="spacey-primer news-figure" data-spacey-primer>
  <div class="spacey-primer__grid">
    <section>
      <h3>{english ? "① Build a graph from tissue measurements" : "① 조직 사진을 graph로 바꾼다"}</h3>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 620 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="spacey-graph-title spacey-graph-desc">
        <title id="spacey-graph-title">{english ? "Cell graph built from spatial proteomics data" : "공간 단백질 조직을 세포 그래프로 바꾸는 개념도"}</title>
        <desc id="spacey-graph-desc">{english ? "Each node represents a cell. Edges connect nearby cells." : "각 세포는 노드가 되고 가까운 세포 사이에 엣지가 연결된다."}</desc
        >
        <g class="edges"
          ><path
            d="M93 65L188 116 90 201 188 116 279 64 188 116 300 185 90 201 201 250 300 185 401 91 300 185 433 235 401 91 530 157 433 235 530 157"
          ></path></g
        >
        <g class="nodes"
          ><circle cx="93" cy="65" r="22"></circle><circle cx="188" cy="116" r="25"></circle><circle
            cx="90"
            cy="201"
            r="24"></circle><circle cx="279" cy="64" r="21"></circle><circle
            cx="300"
            cy="185"
            r="29"></circle><circle cx="201" cy="250" r="19"></circle><circle
            cx="401"
            cy="91"
            r="27"></circle><circle cx="433" cy="235" r="24"></circle><circle
            cx="530"
            cy="157"
            r="27"></circle></g
        >
        <text x="310" y="292" text-anchor="middle"
          >{english ? "Node: cell · Feature: protein marker · Edge: neighbor" : "node = 한 세포 · feature = 단백질 marker · edge = 공간 이웃"}</text
        >
      </svg>
      <p>
        {english ? "Delaunay triangulation connects nearby cells without predefined cell-type or anatomical-region labels." : "Delaunay triangulation으로 가까운 세포를 연결한다. 입력에는 미리 붙인 cell type·해부학 영역 label을 넣지 않는다."}
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3>{english ? "② What do the GNN and explainer do?" : "② GNN과 explainer의 역할을 분리한다"}</h3>
      <div class="pipeline" aria-label={english ? "Prediction and explanation steps" : "예측 모델과 설명 모델의 순서"}>
        <span>spatial graph</span><b>→</b><span>{english ? "GNN prognosis" : "GNN 예후 예측"}</span><b>→</b><span
          >{english ? "Learn edge mask" : "edge mask 학습"}</span
        ><b>→</b><span>{english ? "Connected motif" : "연결된 motif"}</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        {english ? "The GNN first predicts prognosis. Its weights are then fixed while the explainer looks for a small connected subgraph that preserves the prediction." : "먼저 GNN이 예후를 예측한다. 그 가중치를 고정한 뒤 explainer가 예측을 유지하는 작은 연결 subgraph를 찾는다."}
      </p>
      <p class="spacey-primer__warning">
        <strong>{english ? "Interpretation:" : "중요:"}</strong> {english ? "The selected motif contributes to this prediction. Establishing a cause of disease requires other evidence." : "선택된 motif는 예측에 유용한 pattern이지 질병 원인이라는 증명은 아니다."}
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="spacey-primer__wide">
      <h3>{english ? "③ Compare each result with its own baseline" : "③ 숫자는 ‘비교 우위’와 ‘절대 성능’을 함께 읽는다"}</h3>
      <div class="scores">
        <div>
          <span>LUAD progression</span><strong>AUC 0.62</strong><small
            >{english ? "Above baselines of 0.57 and 0.52, with modest discrimination" : "baseline 0.57 / 0.52보다 높지만 절대값은 modest"}</small
          >
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>JacksonFischer survival</span><strong>C-index 0.720</strong><small
            >best baseline 0.617</small
          >
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>METABRIC survival</span><strong>C-index 0.688</strong><small
            >best baseline 0.570</small
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>
        {english ? "The three numbers describe different tasks or splits. Compare each with its baseline on the same dataset under matching conditions." : "서로 다른 task와 split에서 나온 값이므로 세 숫자를 직접 순위처럼 비교하지 않는다. 같은 dataset·평가조건 안에서 baseline과 비교한다."}
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>{english ? "Introductory diagram by JJo" : "JJo 자체 제작 입문 도식"}</strong>
    <span
      >{english ? "An original illustration of graph construction, the roles of prediction and explanation, and the performance limits reported in the Nature Communications paper on SpaCEy." : "Nature Communications SpaCEy 원논문의 graph 구성, prediction–explanation 분리, 보고된 성능 경계를 독자용으로 재구성했다. 논문 Figure와 조직 이미지를 복제하지 않았다."}</span
    >
    <small
      >{english ? "Illustration © JJo. References 1–4 link to the reported results, data and code." : "저작권: JJo 자체 제작 · 외부 원본 이미지 미사용 · 수치와 공개 코드·데이터는 글 아래 참고문헌 1–4에 연결"}</small
    >
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .spacey-primer {
    margin: 1rem 0 1.35rem;
  }
  .spacey-primer__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }
  .spacey-primer section {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-background) 92%, var(--color-muted) 8%);
  }
  .spacey-primer__wide {
    grid-column: 1/-1;
  }
  .spacey-primer h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .spacey-primer svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }
  .spacey-primer svg text {
    fill: currentColor;
    font:
      700 14px/1.2 system-ui,
      sans-serif;
  }
  .edges path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 45%, transparent);
    stroke-width: 4;
  }
  .nodes circle {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, #577f8f 68%, var(--color-background));
    stroke: #315663;
    stroke-width: 3;
  }
  .nodes circle:nth-child(3n) {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, #b26b63 64%, var(--color-background));
  }
  .nodes circle:nth-child(3n + 1) {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, #b99a4e 64%, var(--color-background));
  }
  .spacey-primer section > p {
    margin: 0.62rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted-foreground);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .pipeline {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 0.65rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-muted) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .pipeline span {
    padding: 0.45rem 0.55rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0.45rem;
    background: var(--color-background);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .pipeline b {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .spacey-primer__warning {
    padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #b56452;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, #b56452 10%, transparent);
  }
  .scores {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }
  .scores div {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 0.65rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-muted) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .scores span {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--color-muted-foreground);
  }
  .scores strong {
    font-size: 1.16rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .scores small {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .spacey-primer figcaption {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--color-muted-foreground);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .spacey-primer figcaption strong {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .spacey-primer__grid,
    .scores {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .spacey-primer__wide {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
